  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "WorkspaceComponent manages the primary layout of the editing environment, controlling the visibility and dimensions of side panels and a footer. It implements interactive drag-and-drop resizing using HostListener hooks on the document to adjust internal width and height properties. Upon completion of a resize operation, it notifies the EditorService to trigger a canvas resize, ensuring the UI reflects the new layout state."
  },
